## Sprint A Verification

### A.1: Redis Isolation

| # | Test | Command / Action | Pass Criteria |
|:--|:-----|:-----------------|:--------------|
| 1 | Container running | `docker ps --filter name=stayassist-redis` | Shows `stayassist-redis`, status `Up`, port `6380->6379` |
| 2 | Auth works | `docker exec stayassist-redis redis-cli -a $REDIS_PASSWORD ping` | Returns `PONG` |
| 3 | App connects | Submit complaint via intake form → check server logs | No Redis connection errors |
| 4 | Isolation test | Stop Authentik Redis → submit complaint | Complaint submits (StayAssist Redis unaffected) |
| 5 | Fail-open test | Stop `stayassist-redis` → submit complaint | Complaint submits + console warns about connection error |
| 6 | Rate limit works | Submit 3 complaints in <60s with same mobile | Third complaint returns `Rate limit exceeded` |

