### A.8: API Route Security

| # | Test | Command / Action | Pass Criteria |
|:--|:-----|:-----------------|:--------------|
| 1 | Hospitals protected | `curl -s http://localhost:3000/api/hospitals` | Returns 401 Unauthorized |
| 2 | Hospitals with auth | `curl -H "Cookie: <valid_admin_cookie>" http://localhost:3000/api/hospitals` | Returns hospital list |
